from filename "./brief_manuscript.pya" ob name brief manuscript to name brief manuscript be import do
from filename "./better_compare.pya" ob name better compare to name better compare be import do

su name draw size shorts be map def
  su name width ob num 720 ya
  su name height ob num 1280 ya
  su name negative prompt ob text "text, letters, words, typography, watermark, logo, caption, subtitle, signature, brand name, label, poster, UI, interface, numbers, signage, title card, meme text, overlaid text" ya
prah

exists su name draw system prompt ob text "Educational cinematic still image, no visible text or letters, no watermark. Clean composition, soft natural light, high detail." be text ya
exists su name draw promptify instruction ob text quoted.text.You receive labeled fields: instruction, current_cut, previous_cut, next_cut, full_script, previous_prompt_1, previous_prompt_2.

Follow these rules:
1. Treat current_cut as the primary subject. The image must directly represent current_cut.
2. Use full_script only as supporting context for source-faithful detail.
3. Use previous_prompt_1 and previous_prompt_2 only for novelty checks; do not force continuity with them.
4. The new prompt must be clearly different from previous_prompt_1 and previous_prompt_2, adding a new perspective, detail, or causal angle.
5. If current_cut references a solution, reform, policy, law, or remedy, output a positive sentiment prompt that features the solution mechanism.
6. If current_cut references a problem, debt, oppression, or harm, output a negative sentiment prompt that features causes and harms.
7. Use split-scene only when current_cut explicitly describes contrast or before/after.
8. No visible text in the image.

Return only one image-generation prompt line. No markdown, no quotes, no explanation..text.quoted be text ya
exists su name draw promptify packet template ob text quoted.text.instruction: Turn this teaching cut text into one concise image prompt. Return only the prompt text.
current_cut: [[current_cut]]
previous_cut: [[previous_cut]]
next_cut: [[next_cut]]
full_script: [[full_script]]
previous_prompt_1: [[previous_prompt_1]]
previous_prompt_2: [[previous_prompt_2]].text.quoted be text ya

exists su name thumbnail system prompt ob text quoted.text.You are a YouTube Shorts thumbnail prompt director.

Output exactly one image-generation prompt for a single scroll-stopping scene based on the full context.

Hard rules:
1. Image-only. Absolutely no visible text, letters, words, numbers, logos, watermarks, captions, subtitles, UI, signs, posters, book pages, tablets, engraved writing, or title cards.
2. Do not ask for text overlay and do not include any wording inside the image scene.
3. Pick the strongest hook moment from the script and render it as a concrete visual scene with clear subject, action, and stakes.
4. Favor emotional intensity, cinematic lighting, strong contrast, depth, and clean composition.
5. Keep prompt under 120 words and specific to visuals.
6. Output only the final image prompt.

Context contains FULL SCRIPT and IMAGE PROMPTS ITINERARY. Use both to choose a hook frame that represents the video and opens with high curiosity..text.quoted be text ya
exists su name thumbnail context template ob text quoted.text.FULL SCRIPT:
[[script]]

VIDEO TITLE:
[[video_title]]

THUMBNAIL HEADING:
[[thumbnail_heading]]

VIDEO DESCRIPTION:
[[video_description]].text.quoted be text ya
su name thumbnail context replacements be map def
  su text "[[script]]" ob name text manuscript out ya
  su text "[[video_title]]" ob name text video title ya
  su text "[[thumbnail_heading]]" ob name text video heading ya
  su text "[[video_description]]" ob name text video description ya
prah

exists su name brief video manuscript judge prompter ob text quoted.text.You are comparing two candidate spoken scripts for a 30-60 second history short.

Pick the better script using these priorities:
1. Strong hook and curiosity.
2. Clear factual grounding in the source transcript.
3. Tight momentum and payoff.
4. Shareability and emotional impact.

Return only A or B..text.quoted be text ya

